{"step_index":757,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-08T14:04:56Z","content":"Created At: 2026-11-08T23:04:56+09:00\nCompleted At: 2026-11-08T23:04:56+09:00\nShowing lines 1-179 of 179\n1: #!/usr/bin/env python3\n2: \"\"\"\n3: create_8periods_bulk_and_slab_models.py\n4: 2H-SiC {10-10} 8周期 (16層, 288原子) 真のバルク基準モデル & 自然へき開スラブモデル (真空 5.0 Å) 生成スクリプト\n5: 【準拠ルール】\n6: - AGENTS.md §1: スラブ緩和前の「同一原子数 (288原子) 真のバルクモデル (真空 0 Å) 1点SCF先行確定」\n7: - AGENTS.md §2: Type 1 = C (12.011), Type 2 = Si (28.085)\n8: - AGENTS.md §10: ASE surface(bulk, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=8) による統一生成 (粗結合 1.776 Å 切断)\n9: \"\"\"\n10: import os\n11: import json\n12: import numpy as np\n13: import ase.io\n14: from ase.build import surface\n15: from ase.io.lammpsdata import write_lammps_data\n16: \n17: \n18: def build_8periods_models():\n19:     out_dir = os.path.dirname(os.path.abspath(__file__))\n20:     workspace_dir = os.path.dirname(out_dir)\n21:     cif_input = os.path.join(workspace_dir, \"research_simulations\", \"2H-SiC.cif\")\n22: \n23:     print(f\"Loading 2H-SiC unit cell from {cif_input}...\")\n24:     bulk_cif = ase.io.read(cif_input)\n25: \n26:     # 1. {10-10} 面 8周期モデルの構築 (layers=8 -> 1周期2層なので合計16層)\n27:     slab_unit = surface(bulk_cif, indices=(1, 0, 0), layers=8, vacuum=None)\n28: \n29:     # 2. 面内 3x3 スーパーセル拡張 (合計 288 原子: Si 144, C 144)\n30:     slab_3x3 = slab_unit * (3, 3, 1)\n31: \n32:     # 3. スラブモデル座標調整 (上下に各 5.0 Å、合計 10.0 Å の真空層)\n33:     pos = slab_3x3.positions.copy()\n34:     z_min = float(np.min(pos[:, 2]))\n35:     z_max = float(np.max(pos[:, 2]))\n36:     thickness = z_max - z_min\n37: \n38:     pos[:, 2] = pos[:, 2] - z_min + 5.0\n39:     slab_3x3.positions = pos\n40: \n41:     cell_slab = slab_3x3.cell.copy()\n42:     cell_slab[2, 2] = thickness + 10.0\n43:     slab_3x3.cell = cell_slab\n44:     slab_3x3.pbc = [True, True, True]\n45:     slab_3x3.wrap()\n46: \n47:     # 層間距離プロファイルの検証\n48:     z_unique = np.unique(np.round(slab_3x3.position